</span> <span class="woj"><span class="w" data-strong="G3107">Blessed</span> <span class="added">are</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G3996">they that mourn</span>: <span class="w" data-strong="G3754">for</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G846">they</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G3870">shall be comforted</span>.</span>  <span class="verse" data-osis-id="MAT 5:5" data-n="5"></span> <span class="woj"><span class="w" data-strong="G3107">Blessed</span> <span class="added">are</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G4239">the meek</span>: <span class="w" data-strong="G3754">for</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G846">they</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G2816">shall inherit</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1093">the earth</span>.</span>  <span class="verse" data-osis-id="MAT 5:6" data-n="6"></span> <span class="woj"><span class="w" data-strong="G3107">Blessed</span> <span class="added">are</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G3983">they which do hunger</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G2532">and</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1372">thirst</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1343">after righteousness</span>: <span class="w" data-strong="G3754">for</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G846">they</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G5526">shall be filled</span>.</span>  <span class="verse" data-osis-id="MAT 5:7" data-n="7"></span> <span class="woj"><span class="w" data-strong="G3107">Blessed</span> <span class="added">are</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1655">the merciful</span>: <span class="w" data-strong="G3754">for</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G846">they</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G1653">shall obtain mercy</span>.</span>  <span class="verse" data-osis-id="MAT 5:8" data-n="8"></span> <span class="woj"><span class="w" data-strong="G3107">Blessed</span> <span class="added">are</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G2513">the pure</span> <span class="w" data-strong="G2588">in heart</span>: <span class="w" data-strong="G3754">for